From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 15:11:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(ui): defer panorama prefetch and gate scroller capture

Shared core optimization with Anikku 0076. User preview.27 traces still show 40.68ms re-entry / 19.77ms masonry measurement and a 21.52ms fling frame. Measure/place only viewport cells and submit one approaching row to Compose frame-budgeted prefetch, cancelling stale requests. Stop the independent fast-scroller Haze source/effect when its thumb is hidden or disallowed. Record inclusive source and layout stages only when diagnostics are enabled. Preserve existing scrolling, anchors, corners, touch handling and glass defaults. Mihon additionally exports format4 arrival timestamps and bounded worst/recent work samples, retains phase consensus for repeated frame times, and provides an in-memory glass A/B switch restored when recording is disabled. Anikku retains its existing format1 recorder; no unrelated diagnostics or image toggles are ported.
